- that a physical system realizes strict FIN;
- that visible dynamics is Markovian;
- that nature has the constructed hidden bit/sign-word memory;
- a physical upper bound on hidden-state dimension;
- a calibrated detector/confusion matrix or real efficiency model;
- a physical clock or SI time unit;
- that every analytic function of `A` shares the strict carrier;
- a unique state category, channel, continuum operator, spacetime, quantum
